{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111405","id":2896870893,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6sqr3t","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111405","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111405.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111405.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111405","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111405/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111405/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111405/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/33689d7beb670301e1b5da8bfa21e4991263edbd","number":111405,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Remove transitive rendering includes from `node.h`","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"- Helps address #111218 \r\n\r\nThis PR reduces total compile time by 3% (going by a single test). Further, it will benefit rendering contributors  because changes to rendering files will no longer cause a recompilation of almost all compile units.\r\n\r\n## Explanation\r\n\r\n`node.h` is a giant include hub. Most of our compile units include it in some way.\r\nIt currently has an include path to rendering (`mesh.h`, `shader.h`, `rendering_server.h`). However, most `Node` users don't interact with rendering at all.\r\n\r\nThis PR removes this include path (by removing the `mesh.h` include `scene_tree.h`), simply by forward-declaring `ArrayMesh`.\r\n\r\nThe cascading changes are individually simple and logical:\r\n- Explicit includes in headers to previously transitively included headers.\r\n- Explicit includes to `mesh.h` in cpp files that have meshes of their own.\r\n- Forward declarations of other mesh types in headers that only use them internally.\r\n\r\nFurther, I'm making use of `STATIC_ASSERT_INCOMPLETE_TYPE` to prevent regression of this PR.","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098009,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgwMDk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:buildsystem","name":"topic:buildsystem","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":3240950060,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMjQwOTUwMDYw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/performance","name":"performance","description":"","color":"447777","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":12939969,"node_id